{"ID":"20240504154557-h3oppkt","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240504154557-h3oppkt","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240504154557-h3oppkt\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240618101320-khy7y2g\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240607094510-kd3tx7l\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240618102240-dl0day3\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:2,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:2\u0026#125;","title":"022天门冬（天冬、武竹）","type":"doc","updated":"20240801125742"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240711173925-zfauo4j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240711173925-zfauo4j","updated":"20240711173925"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【产地】\t主产广西、四川、贵州等地。\n【性状】\t干燥的块根呈长圆纺锤形，中部肥满，两端渐细而钝，长620cm，中部直径0.52cm。表面黄白色或浅黄棕色，呈油润半透明状，有时有细纵纹或纵沟，偶有未除净的黄棕色外皮。干透者质坚硬而脆，未干透者质柔软，有粘性，断面蜡质样，黄白色，半透明，中间有不透明的细木心。臭微，味甘微苦。\n【性味】\t甘、苦，寒。\n【功效】\t养阴清热，润燥生津。主治肺结核，支气管炎，白喉，百日咳，口燥咽干，热病口渴，糖尿病，大便燥结；外用治疮疡肿毒，蛇咬伤。"}]},{"ID":"20240711173925-6pm9rug","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240711173925-6pm9rug","updated":"20240711173925"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240206092323-x1q8ue4.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240711173925-lphok95","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240711173925-lphok95","updated":"20240711173925"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"天冬"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/天冬-20240205170042-384zlfm.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240618101320-khy7y2g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240618101320-khy7y2g","updated":"20240711173916"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 365px;","style":"width: 355px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240618101320-492lojg.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 355px;\" parent-style=\"width: 365px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240801124455-dxxx48v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240801124455-dxxx48v","updated":"20240801124455"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 658px;","style":"width: 648px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"天门冬 (12)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/天门冬 12-20240801124314-8ucd3ld.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 648px;\" parent-style=\"width: 658px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 637px;","style":"width: 627px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"天门冬 (13)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/天门冬 13-20240801124414-5cmmopt.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 627px;\" parent-style=\"width: 637px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240801115940-do4e0mj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240801115940-do4e0mj","updated":"20240801124433"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data